# dfu_smoke.jgs -- jgraph.usb.dfulist, dfu, dfufile and dfusuffix (device classes plan, stage D8, ADR 0191).
# JGraph extensions with no MATLAB counterpart, so this is a JGraph-only fixture and
# expected/dfu_smoke.txt is written from the rule. The cases are MATLAB code in helpers/dfu_smoke.m:
# the device cases run on jgraph.internal.dfusim's simulated loaders, and the rest answer the same on
# any Windows machine with USB. Nothing is sent to a real device.
